{"id":"412615","name":"腌苏子叶","author":"朝族媳妇辣白菜","authorId":"10218894","desc":"","cover":"images/412615/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苏子叶","amount":"50张"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1/4个"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"1大勺"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"1大勺"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"2大勺"},{"name":"糖浆","amount":"1大勺"},{"name":"芝麻","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"香油","amount":"0.5勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红辣椒切成碎末。","img":"images/412615/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"大葱切成碎末。","img":"images/412615/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洋葱切成碎末。","img":"images/412615/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洋葱末、大葱末、红辣椒末倒入碗中。","img":"images/412615/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入蒜末。","img":"images/412615/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入辣椒面。","img":"images/412615/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入酱油。","img":"images/412615/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入糖浆。","img":"images/412615/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入芝麻。","img":"images/412615/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入香油。","img":"images/412615/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/412615/step_11.gif"},{"step":12,"desc":"酱料涂均匀涂抹至苏子叶的两面。","img":"images/412615/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"腌制一周后即可食用喽。","img":"images/412615/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"1.苏子叶现采摘的为最佳。\n2.苏子叶按每张均匀的涂抹酱料，这样入味才最好，不要怕麻烦。\n3.腌制一周以上再食用味道最好。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}